<style>
  @page {
    size: A4;
    margin: 0;
  }
  .page {
    width: 794px;
    height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden;
    page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, "DejaVu Sans", "Liberation Sans";
  }
  .page:last-child {
    page-break-after: auto;
  }
  /* Basic styling to mimic document structure */
  h1, h2, h3, h4 {
    margin-top: 0;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  p {
    margin-bottom: 15px;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  .step-instruction {
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  .image-placeholder {
    width: 100%;
    height: 300px; /* Placeholder height for visual representation */
    background-color: #f0f0f0;
    border: 1px solid #ccc;
    margin: 20px 0;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    color: #666;
    font-size: 14px;
  }
</style>

<div class="page">
  <p>To get your Unofficial Transcripts follow the steps below.</p>

  <div class="step-instruction">
    <p>1. Click on the link <span data-field="link_url">{{ link_url }}</span></p>
    <p>2. Enter your <span data-field="username_field">{{ username_field }}</span> and click 'Continue'</p>
  </div>

  <div class="image-placeholder">
    [Image Placeholder for Sign In Form 1]
  </div>

  <div class="step-instruction">
    <p>3. Click on <span data-field="forgot_password_link">{{ forgot_password_link }}</span></p>
  </div>

  <div class="image-placeholder">
    [Image Placeholder for Sign In Form 2]
  </div>

  <div class="step-instruction">
    <p>4. Enter <span data-field="username_field_2">{{ username_field_2 }}</span> and personal email address registered in Self-Service</p>
  </div>

  <div class="image-placeholder">
    [Image Placeholder for Self-Service Login Form]
  </div>

  <div class="step-instruction">
    <p>5. If your account can be identified with the supplied email address, follow the directions in the email you receive - similar to the example shown below.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="image-placeholder">
    [Image Placeholder for Email Notification]
  </div>

  <div class="step-instruction">
    <p>6. Once logged in, select <span data-field="menu_item_academics">{{ menu_item_academics }}</span> -> Unofficial Transcript</p>
  </div>

  <div class="image-placeholder">
    [Image Placeholder for Navigation Menu]
  </div>

  <div class="step-instruction">
    <p>7. Click the link to download a copy of your transcript</p>
  </div>

  <div class="image-placeholder">
    [Image Placeholder for Transcript Download Screen]
  </div>

  <p>If you have questions or difficulties, please contact Tech Support <span data-field="support_phone">{{ support_phone }}</span> or <span data-field="support_email">{{ support_email }}</span>.</p>
</div>